# NOTE: fakeredis is deliberately NOT used here — memory/bus.py talks to
# Upstash's REST-based `upstash_redis.Redis` client, not redis-py, and
# fakeredis emulates the redis-py wire protocol, not the Upstash REST
# surface. tests/conftest.py ships a small hand-rolled FakeRedis instead
# that matches the 4 methods bus.py actually calls (get/set/delete/mget).
